    "reviews": "\u201cGrab this with both hands. It\u2019s really solid stuff, a fun story, and a lovely entry-level tactical combat game, and indeed infinitely more accessible visual novel.\u201d<br>88 \u2013 Buried Treasure<br><br>\u201cWintermoor Tactics Club reminds me a lot of the Persona series: both games sit on that razor\u2019s edge of combining together entertaining combat with social gameplay; both tie into each other in a fluid way that makes the game shine.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 RPGamer<br><br>\u201cRPGFan Games of the Year 2020: Best Strategy RPG\u201d<br>RPGFan<br>",
